          "Group ten indicators under light, society, and nature",
          "Average a hierarchy weight, an entropy weight, and a variation weight",
          "Add the three group scores and read the band",
          "Trace each action through correlation and a network",
          "Keep the strategy with the largest gain at equal effort"
        ],
        "decision_consequence": "Cut the artificial light in both the city and the countryside, and tell New York readers to light only where needed.",
